# Cloudflare Pages – HTTP headers
# ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ Cloudflare Pages ອ່ານເອງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຍັງເພີ່ມ
# This file is read automatically by Cloudflare Pages. No dashboard setup needed.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()

# ຮູບ ແລະ ວິດີໂອ ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍປ່ຽນ → ໃຫ້ເບຣົາເຊີເກັບໄວ້ດົນ (ໂຫຼດໄວຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ)
/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/videos/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# ຄູ່ມືພາຍໃນ — ບອກເຄື່ອງຄົ້ນຫາບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກັບເຂົ້າດັດຊະນີ
# ໝາຍເຫດ: ຍັງເປີດອ່ານໄດ້ຢູ່ ຖ້າຮູ້ທີ່ຢູ່ ຖ້າຢາກເຊື່ອງແທ້ໆ ຢ່າອັບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຂຶ້ນເວັບ
# Internal handbook — tells crawlers not to index it. It is still readable by anyone
# who knows the URL; to hide it completely, keep the file out of the upload folder.
/README-TH.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
